mostly on which word the token is, and is close to a fixed value for each word. Words are
grouped by how strongly they push it negative:

- "almost" is about -10. Its equivalents nearly, quasi, virtually, casi, почти, 几乎 and ほぼ
  are about -4 to -7.
- Words meaning "almost, but not quite" (pseudo-, practically, hardly, barely, semi-, 大约,
  将近, 接近) are about -2.
- Softer hedges (approximately, roughly, essentially, somewhat, mostly, pretty, basically,
  largely, slightly) are about -1.2.
- Quantity and superlative words (more, most, only, something, least, early, near, quite,
  -like) are about -0.9. Weaker ones (much, less, half, exactly, highly, close, about,
  around, approx) are about -0.2 to -0.6.

