"""Hearing and listening word detector (layers.0.mlp.down_proj:4139).

What it does: the component is a word detector for hearing. It goes strongly negative on
words about hearing and listening ("hear", "heard", "hearing", "listen", "listener", and the
Chinese 听 and 聽), more weakly on sound and audio words (sound, audio, ear, headphones),
on people who listen or read (speaker, audience, viewer, reader), and only slightly on
eat, drink, watch and read verbs. It is also negative on "to" right after "listen"
("listening to"). Everywhere else it is 0. The value for each group is the average
activation of that group on sample text.
"""
READS = ()

